:`Leave {{count}} calendar`,\"SharedCalendarGuidelinesCalendarListDialog__button--leave_other\":`Leave {{count}} calendars`,SharedCalendarGuidelinesCalendarListDialog__description:`If you do not agree to the Shared Calendar Guidelines, you will leave the calendars that have two or more members listed below. The calendars cannot be viewed after leaving.`,SharedCalendarGuidelinesCalendarListDialog__heading:`You are about to leave shared calendar(s)`,\"SharedCalendarGuidelinesConfirmation__button--leave\":`Leave`,SharedCalendarGuidelinesConfirmation__description:`If you do not agree to the Guidelines, you will leave calendars shared with two or more members and will no longer be able to view them.`,SharedCalendarGuidelinesConfirmation__heading:`Are you sure you want to leave the shared calendar(s)?`,\"SharedCalendarGuidelinesDialog__button--agree\":`Continue using`,\"SharedCalendarGuidelinesDialog__button--disagree\":`Disagree and leave calendar(s)`,SharedCalendarGuidelinesDialog__description:`In shared calendars, events and other information added by members are shared among participants.\nWe have created the “Shared Calendar Guidelines” to explain how this shared information is managed. This does not change how information has been handled up to now, but is intended to help everyone continue using the service with confidence. (See details <Link>here</Link>)\n\nPlease review the guidelines and provide your consent.\n\nIf you do not agree, you will leave any shared calendars you have joined. In addition, if you do not agree by {{deadline}}, you will no longer be able to use the “Shared Calendar” feature until consent is provided.`,\"SharedCalendarGuidelinesDialog__dismissAlert--body\":`Please review by {{deadline}}`,\"SharedCalendarGuidelinesDialog__dismissAlert--title\":`Please try again later`,SharedCalendarGuidelinesDialog__heading:`Please agree to the\nShared Calendar Guidelines`,\"SharedCalendarGuidelinesDialog__label--checkbox\":`I agree to the <Link>Shared Calen